"the internationalization of Regrello's enterprise platform – acquired by "
"Salesforce in late 2025 – reorganizing more than 2,000 files along the way. "
"Code quality is not an end in itself to me but developer experience: you can "
"tell good architecture by how easy the next change is."
msgstr ""
